#. module: zehntech_access_restriction_by_ip
#: model:mail.template,body_html:zehntech_access_restriction_by_ip.email_template_blocked_login
msgid ""
"\n"
"                \n"
"                <p>Dear Admin,</p>\n"
"                <p>A login attempt by user <strong><t t-esc=\"object.partner_id.name or object.name or 'Unknown User'\"/></strong> from IP address <strong><t t-esc=\"ctx.get('blocked_ip')\"/></strong> was blocked due to IP restrictions.</p>\n"
"                <p>Please review this activity to ensure the security of your system.</p>\n"
"                <p>Best regards,</p>\n"
"                <p>Your IT team</p>\n"
"                \n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                \n"
"                <p>Cher administrateur,</p>\n"
"                <p>Une tentative de connexion par l'utilisateur <strong><t t-esc=\"object.partner_id.name or object.name or 'Unknown User'\"/></strong> à partir de l'adresse IP <strong><t t-esc=\"ctx.get('blocked_ip')\"/></strong> a été bloqué en raison de restrictions IP.</p>\n"
"                <p>Veuillez examiner cette activité pour garantir la sécurité de votre système.</p>\n"
"                <p>Cordialement,</p>\n"
"                <p>Votre équipe informatique</p>\n"
"                \n"
"            "

